  "documents_description": "Facts read from the table of a DART exchange filing that has no structured endpoint (app.clients.dart_tables). The parser is chosen by the filing's category and normalised report name. The unit of an amount or ratio is the one the filing states (백만원, 조원, 대, 원, %), so the fields carry unit null. Units sold are kind amount with the unit 대. A '-' cell gives no fact; a table that does not have the expected shape gives no facts, and the filing is then summarised by the model. The bundle origin is dartdoc:<table>.<key>; the pinned check re-reads dart/document/<rcept_no>.xml with the same parser.",
